<title>USA: Texas/w Okla fed cattle market inactive - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla fed cattle market inactive - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was inactive in the Panhandle area early Monday, USDA said. Slaughter steers and heifers not tested. Feedlots reporting moderate inquiry from buyers; 7,600 head confirmed for the week to date.</p>
<p>Confirmed - None</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
